> Note: "tty sync point" is an ad hoc term; hope you understand what I mean.

This started when I updated the game server playground; apparently
NetHack (and Spork) don't output the proper escape code for
"clear screen" anymore, but rather codes for "move cursor to top left
and clear screen below cursor", and dgamelaunch only detects the
"clear screen" codes.

I'm not sure if this is a ncurses or a terminfo change.

I "fixed" NetHack by forcing it to output the "clear screen" escape code
in the code itself (instead of relying ncurses/terminfo for the code),
but forgot to "fix" SporkHack; I'll update Spork soonish.

